; SweK_Engine fbxAnimIngest-selfcheck fixture -- hand-authored, original content, ASCII FBX 7.4.
; Not derived from any third-party asset -- written for this repository, zero licensing question.
; Task #59 remaining-gaps round. Two unrigged bones, no geometry (mapFbxAnimations() reads
; group.animations up front, independent of whether a mesh is found -- see gpu/fbxLoad.js), and TWO
; AnimationStacks:
;   AnimStack::ClipA -- "root"'s rotation (a QuaternionKeyframeTrack exercising a non-default
;     RotationOrder (enum 5, "XYZ") plus non-identity PreRotation (30,0,0 deg) and PostRotation
;     (0,45,0 deg), composed by FBXLoader's own generateRotationTrack -- NOT re-derived here) and
;     "mover"'s position (a VectorKeyframeTrack, plain values, no trig).
;   AnimStack::ClipB -- "mover"'s scale (a second VectorKeyframeTrack, in a separate stack/layer from
;     ClipA, proving multi-clip files resolve to distinct entries in mapFbxAnimations()'s output).
; See gpu/fixtures/PROVENANCE.md's entry for this file, gpu/fbxLoad.js's header, and
; tools/ship/fbxIngest-selfcheck.mjs section 7 for exactly what this exercises and how the composed
; rotation quaternions were verified (an independent three.js Quaternion/Euler oracle script, not
; hand trigonometry).

